  "description": "Sub-workflow for a direct message to the Lark content bot {message_id}. Re-reads the message from the Lark API, ignores redeliveries, links the first sender's open_id in settings and ignores other senders. Then: /commands; replies to an offer card (re-propose with the note), a draft card (rewrite), a material question (save and draft), a result question (save the sales) or a retro (add a rule); anything else goes to the story bank.",
